*.sqlite3
*.log

# Internal Agency Docs, Client Decks & Worker Secrets (Never expose publicly)
PROJECT_MEMORY.md
*Commercial_Proposal*.pdf
*Mobile_Deck*.pdf
worker/.dev.vars
.firebase/
firebase-debug.log
firestore-debug.log

# System & OS Files
